This license covers the source code of this repository (everything outside
`src/data/`, `public/donate/` and `brand/`).

The prompt data in `src/data/` is collected from third-party open-source
collections and stays under each collection's own license (CC0 1.0, CC BY 4.0
or MIT). The README and the site's Credits page list every collection, its
author and its license. Sample images and video clips are not part of this
repository; they are loaded from the original collections' servers.

The fillprompt name, logo and the files in `brand/` and `public/donate/` are
not licensed for reuse.
